  "text": "Allergies:\nACE Inhibitors / ___ Receptor Antagonist / diltiazem\n\nChief Complaint:\nTB rule out\n\nHistory of Present Illness:\n___ w/ hx of ESRD on dialysis, DM, HTN who presents with\nconcern for abnormal PPD and CT findings. Patient had CT scan\nperformed on ___. He reports he received phone call from\nhis PCPs office notifying him that they were concerned for\ntuberculosis and referring him to emergency department. \n\nHe attempted to get dialysis performed today, but was unable to\ndue to concern for active tuberculosis. He has a history of BCG\nvaccine as a child. No history of tuberculosis. He is an\nimmigrant from ___. He reports living in the ___ for\nnearly ___ years. He has not traveled outside the country in ___\nyears. No history of incarceration. He otherwise feels well. \n\nNo hemoptysis, fevers, weight loss. Denies fever, chills, chest\npain, shortness of breath, nausea, vomiting, change in bowel or\nbladder function, change in vision or hearing, bruising,\nadenopathy, new rash or lesion.\n\nDischarge Diagnosis:\nTB rule out",
